        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<hr><h1 id="🛠️-常用运维脚本汇总：跨平台工具箱"><a href="#🛠️-常用运维脚本汇总：跨平台工具箱" class="headerlink" title="🛠️ 常用运维脚本汇总：跨平台工具箱"></a>🛠️ 常用运维脚本汇总：跨平台工具箱</h1><p>本博文记录了我在实际工作中经常使用的脚本。所有脚本均经过实测，能够有效提升工作效率。</p><hr><h2 id="一、-Windows-平台工具-CMD-BAT"><a href="#一、-Windows-平台工具-CMD-BAT" class="headerlink" title="一、 Windows 平台工具 (CMD/BAT)"></a>一、 Windows 平台工具 (CMD/BAT)</h2><p>这些脚本基于 <strong>Batch (批处理)</strong> 编写，适用于 Windows 系统，保存为 <code>.bat</code> 后缀。</p><h3 id="1-Nginx-进程管理工具-NgControl-bat"><a href="#1-Nginx-进程管理工具-NgControl-bat" class="headerlink" title="1. Nginx 进程管理工具 (NgControl.bat)"></a>1. Nginx 进程管理工具 (<code>NgControl.bat</code>)</h3><ul><li><strong>脚本类型</strong>：Windows Batch</li><li><strong>用途</strong>：提供菜单化界面，一键查找 Windows 环境下的 Nginx 进程，并支持强制终止进程，解决 Nginx 重启失败的问题。</li></ul><p>代码段</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">@echo offchcp <span class="token number">65001</span> <span class="token operator">&gt;</span>nultitle Nginx windows环境查杀工具:MENUcls<span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span>        Nginx 管理工具<span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token number">1</span>. 查找 nginx 进程<span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token number">2</span>. 终止 nginx 进程<span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token number">3</span>. 退出<span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token builtin class-name">set</span> /p <span class="token assign-left variable">choice</span><span class="token operator">=</span>请选择操作 <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token number">1</span>-3<span class="token punctuation">]</span>： <span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token string">"%choice%"</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token string">"1"</span> goto FIND<span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token string">"%choice%"</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token string">"2"</span> goto KILL<span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token string">"%choice%"</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token string">"3"</span> <span class="token builtin class-name">exit</span>goto MENU:FINDcls<span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> 正在查找 nginx 进程<span class="token punctuation">..</span>.<span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> --------------------------------------tasklist <span class="token operator">|</span> findstr /i <span class="token string">"nginx"</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> --------------------------------------echo.pausegoto MENU:SHOWPORTcls<span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> nginx PID: %PID%<span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> --------------------------------------<span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> 正在查询端口信息<span class="token punctuation">..</span>.<span class="token function">netstat</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-ano</span> <span class="token operator">|</span> findstr <span class="token string">"%PID%"</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> --------------------------------------echo.pausegoto MENU:KILLcls<span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> 正在查找 nginx 进程<span class="token punctuation">..</span>.tasklist /fi <span class="token string">"imagename eq nginx.exe"</span>echo.<span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> 正在结束 nginx 进程<span class="token punctuation">..</span>.taskkill /fi <span class="token string">"imagename eq nginx.exe"</span> /Fecho.<span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> 操作完成！pausegoto MENU<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h3 id="2-端口占用杀手"><a href="#2-端口占用杀手" class="headerlink" title="2. 端口占用杀手"></a>2. 端口占用杀手</h3><ul><li><strong>脚本类型</strong>：Windows Batch</li><li><strong>用途</strong>：输入端口号即可自动识别并结束占用该端口的 PID 进程，常用于释放被占用的 80、8080 等端口。</li></ul><p>代码段</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">@echo offchcp <span class="token number">65001</span><span class="token builtin class-name">set</span> /p <span class="token assign-left variable">port</span><span class="token operator">=</span>请输入端口号:<span class="token keyword">for</span> /f <span class="token string">"tokens=5"</span> %%a <span class="token keyword">in</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'netstat -ano ^| findstr "%port%"'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token keyword">do</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>    taskkill /PID %%a /F<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h3 id="3-微信多开脚本"><a href="#3-微信多开脚本" class="headerlink" title="3. 微信多开脚本"></a>3. 微信多开脚本</h3><ul><li><strong>脚本类型</strong>：Windows Batch</li><li><strong>用途</strong>：快速启动两个微信进程。<em>注意：请根据实际安装路径修改代码中的目录。</em></li></ul><p>代码段</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">@echo offstart <span class="token string">""</span> <span class="token string">"D:\Apps\Liv\Tencent\Weixin\Weixin.exe"</span>start <span class="token string">""</span> <span class="token string">"D:\Apps\Liv\Tencent\Weixin\Weixin.exe"</span><span class="token builtin class-name">exit</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><hr><h2 id="二、-Linux-平台工具"><a href="#二、-Linux-平台工具" class="headerlink" title="二、 Linux 平台工具"></a>二、 Linux 平台工具</h2><p>针对 Linux 环境（以 Ubuntu 24.04 为主）的系统优化与配置脚本。</p><h3 id="1-系统别名配置-Alias"><a href="#1-系统别名配置-Alias" class="headerlink" title="1. 系统别名配置 (Alias)"></a>1. 系统别名配置 (<code>Alias</code>)</h3><ul><li><strong>脚本类型</strong>：Bash 配置</li><li><strong>用途</strong>：在 <code>/root/.bashrc</code> 中定义常用命令的缩写，极大简化 Docker 操作和系统清理操作。</li></ul><p>代码段</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token comment"># 修改/root/.bashrc文件</span><span class="token function">vi</span> /root/.bashrc<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token comment"># 修改/root/.bashrc文件</span><span class="token function">vi</span> /root/.bashrc<span class="token comment"># 修改/root/.bashrc文件后执行 source /root/.bashrc 生效</span><span class="token builtin class-name">alias</span> <span class="token assign-left variable">rm</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">'rm -i'</span><span class="token builtin class-name">alias</span> <span class="token assign-left variable">cp</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">'cp -i'</span><span class="token builtin class-name">alias</span> <span class="token assign-left variable">mv</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">'mv -i'</span><span class="token builtin class-name">alias</span> <span class="token assign-left variable">cls</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">'clear'</span><span class="token comment"># 简化 Docker 常用查看命令</span><span class="token builtin class-name">alias</span> <span class="token assign-left variable">dps</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">'docker ps --format "table {{.ID}}\t{{.Image}}\t{{.Ports}}\t{{.Status}}\t{{.Names}}"'</span><span class="token builtin class-name">alias</span> <span class="token assign-left variable">dis</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">'docker images'</span><span class="token builtin class-name">alias</span> <span class="token assign-left variable">dexe</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">'docker exec -it'</span><span class="token builtin class-name">alias</span> <span class="token assign-left variable">dlog</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">'docker logs'</span><span class="token comment"># Source global definitions</span><span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-f</span> /etc/bashrc <span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token keyword">then</span>        <span class="token builtin class-name">.</span> /etc/bashrc<span class="token keyword">fi</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token comment"># 然后，执行命令使别名生效</span><span class="token builtin class-name">source</span> /root/.bashrc<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h3 id="2-虚拟内存-Swap"><a href="#2-虚拟内存-Swap" class="headerlink" title="2. 虚拟内存 (Swap)"></a>2. 虚拟内存 (Swap)</h3><ul><li><strong>脚本类型</strong>：Bash 指令</li><li><strong>用途</strong>：为内存较小的服务器增加 4GB 虚拟内存，并优化 <code>swappiness</code>（设置为 80），提高系统稳定性。</li></ul><p>代码段</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token comment"># 1. 创建4GB的交换文件</span>fallocate <span class="token parameter variable">-l</span> 4G /swapfile<span class="token comment"># 如果fallocate不可用，使用以下命令（会稍慢）：</span><span class="token comment"># dd if=/dev/zero of=/swapfile bs=1M count=4096</span><span class="token comment"># 2. 设置权限</span><span class="token function">chmod</span> <span class="token number">600</span> /swapfile<span class="token comment"># 3. 格式化</span><span class="token function">mkswap</span> /swapfile<span class="token comment"># 4. 启用</span><span class="token function">swapon</span> /swapfile<span class="token comment"># 5. 永久生效：将交换文件信息添加到fstab</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">'/swapfile none swap sw 0 0'</span> <span class="token operator">&gt;&gt;</span> /etc/fstab<span class="token comment"># 6. 验证</span><span class="token function">free</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-h</span><span class="token comment"># 查看当前swappiness</span><span class="token function">cat</span> /proc/sys/vm/swappiness<span class="token comment"># 临时设置为80</span><span class="token function">sysctl</span> <span class="token assign-left variable">vm.swappiness</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token number">80</span><span class="token comment"># 永久生效</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">'vm.swappiness=80'</span> <span class="token operator">&gt;&gt;</span> /etc/sysctl.conf<span class="token function">sysctl</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-p</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><hr><h2 id="三、-Docker-自动化工具-Shell-Bash"><a href="#三、-Docker-自动化工具-Shell-Bash" class="headerlink" title="三、 Docker 自动化工具 (Shell/Bash)"></a>三、 Docker 自动化工具 (Shell/Bash)</h2><h3 id="0-上传脚本后先进行赋权"><a href="#0-上传脚本后先进行赋权" class="headerlink" title="0.上传脚本后先进行赋权"></a>0.上传脚本后先进行赋权</h3><ul><li>赋予执行权限：Linux 系统默认不允许直接运行上传的文件。<code>chmod +x</code> 是给文件添加“可执行”权限。</li><li>丢入后台运行 (核心)：**<code>2&gt;&amp;1</code><strong>：将错误信息也一并写入日志，防止脚本报错你却不知道，</strong><code>&amp;</code>**：让脚本在后台运行，这样你可以继续在终端输入其他命令。</li></ul><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">chmod</span> +x pull_images.sh<span class="token function">nohup</span> ./pull_images.sh <span class="token operator">&gt;</span> pull_images.log <span class="token operator"><span class="token file-descriptor important">2</span>&gt;</span><span class="token file-descriptor important">&amp;1</span> <span class="token operator">&amp;</span><span class="token function">ps</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-ef</span> <span class="token operator">|</span> <span class="token function">grep</span> pull_images.sh<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h3 id="1-容器日志清理脚本"><a href="#1-容器日志清理脚本" class="headerlink" title="1. 容器日志清理脚本"></a>1. 容器日志清理脚本</h3><ul><li><strong>脚本类型</strong>：Shell (<code>/bin/sh</code>)</li><li><strong>用途</strong>：Docker 容器运行久了产生海量日志，该脚本可安全清空 <code>/var/lib/docker/containers/</code> 下的所有 <code>.log</code> 文件。</li></ul><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token shebang important">#!/bin/sh </span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"======== start clean docker containers logs ========"</span>  <span class="token assign-left variable">logs</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token variable"><span class="token variable">$(</span><span class="token function">find</span> /var/lib/docker/containers/ <span class="token parameter variable">-name</span> *-json.log<span class="token variable">)</span></span>  <span class="token keyword">for</span> <span class="token for-or-select variable">log</span> <span class="token keyword">in</span> <span class="token variable">$logs</span>          <span class="token keyword">do</span>                  <span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"clean logs : <span class="token variable">$log</span>"</span>                  <span class="token function">cat</span> /dev/null <span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token variable">$log</span>          <span class="token keyword">done</span>  <span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"======== end clean docker containers logs ========"</span>  <span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h3 id="2-镜像批量拉取-pull-images-sh"><a href="#2-镜像批量拉取-pull-images-sh" class="headerlink" title="2. 镜像批量拉取 (pull_images.sh)"></a>2. 镜像批量拉取 (<code>pull_images.sh</code>)</h3><ul><li><strong>脚本类型</strong>：Bash</li><li><strong>用途</strong>：一键部署常用中间件环境（MySQL、Redis、Nacos、Jenkins 等。</li></ul><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token shebang important">#!/bin/bash</span><span class="token comment"># 定义要拉取的镜像列表</span><span class="token assign-left variable">IMAGES</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>    elasticsearch:7.12.1    kibana:7.12.1    gogs/gogs:0.12    jenkins/jenkins:2.361.1-lts-jdk11    nacos/nacos-server:v2.1.0-slim    openjdk:11.0-jre-buster    rabbitmq:3.8-management    redis:latest    xuxueli/xxl-job-admin:2.3.0    mysql:8.4.7    mongo:latest    imaegoo/twikoo:latest    minio/minio:RELEASE.2025-04-22T22-12-26Z    dko0/lsky-pro:latest    seataio/seata-server:1.5.2    nginx:1.13.8<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"--- 📥 开始批量拉取 Docker 镜像 ---"</span><span class="token keyword">for</span> <span class="token for-or-select variable">IMAGE</span> <span class="token keyword">in</span> <span class="token string">"<span class="token variable">${IMAGES<span class="token punctuation">[</span>@<span class="token punctuation">]</span>}</span>"</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token keyword">do</span>    <span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"---"</span>    <span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"正在拉取: <span class="token variable">${IMAGE}</span>"</span>        <span class="token comment"># 执行 docker pull 命令</span>    <span class="token function">docker</span> pull <span class="token string">"<span class="token variable">$IMAGE</span>"</span>        <span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span> <span class="token variable">$?</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-eq</span> <span class="token number">0</span> <span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token keyword">then</span>        <span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"✅ <span class="token variable">${IMAGE}</span> 拉取成功."</span>    <span class="token keyword">else</span>        <span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"❌ <span class="token variable">${IMAGE}</span> 拉取失败. 请检查网络连接或镜像标签是否正确."</span>    <span class="token keyword">fi</span><span class="token keyword">done</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"--- 🎉 所有镜像拉取任务完成 ---"</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h3 id="3-镜像批量打包-save-all-images-sh"><a href="#3-镜像批量打包-save-all-images-sh" class="headerlink" title="3. 镜像批量打包 (save_all_images.sh)"></a>3. 镜像批量打包 (<code>save_all_images.sh</code>)</h3><ul><li><strong>脚本类型</strong>：Bash</li><li><strong>用途</strong>：用于“有网”和“无网”环境的镜像中转。支持批量拉取常用镜像清单，并能一键将本地所有有效镜像打包为 <code>.tar</code> 文件。</li></ul><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token shebang important">#!/bin/bash</span><span class="token comment"># --- 配置 ---</span><span class="token comment"># 定义保存文件的目录。默认保存到当前目录下的一个新文件夹</span><span class="token assign-left variable">SAVE_DIR</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">"docker_images_backup"</span><span class="token assign-left variable">LOG_FILE</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">"<span class="token variable">${SAVE_DIR}</span>/packing_log_<span class="token variable"><span class="token variable">$(</span><span class="token function">date</span> +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S<span class="token variable">)</span></span>.log"</span><span class="token comment"># 创建保存目录（如果不存在）</span><span class="token function">mkdir</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-p</span> <span class="token string">"<span class="token variable">${SAVE_DIR}</span>"</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"--- 🚀 开始打包本机所有 Docker 镜像到 .tar 文件 ---"</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"保存目录: <span class="token variable"><span class="token variable">$(</span><span class="token builtin class-name">pwd</span><span class="token variable">)</span></span>/<span class="token variable">${SAVE_DIR}</span>"</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"日志文件: <span class="token variable">${LOG_FILE}</span>"</span><span class="token comment"># 将所有输出重定向到日志文件，并在终端打印关键信息</span><span class="token builtin class-name">exec</span> <span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token function">tee</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-a</span> <span class="token string">"<span class="token variable">$LOG_FILE</span>"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator"><span class="token file-descriptor important">2</span>&gt;</span><span class="token file-descriptor important">&amp;1</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"<span class="token variable"><span class="token variable">$(</span><span class="token function">date</span><span class="token variable">)</span></span>: 脚本开始执行"</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"---"</span><span class="token comment"># 1. 获取本机所有镜像的列表 (REPOSITORY:TAG)</span><span class="token comment"># 排除掉 &lt;none&gt;:&lt;none&gt; 的悬空镜像</span><span class="token assign-left variable">IMAGES</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token variable"><span class="token variable">$(</span><span class="token function">docker</span> images <span class="token parameter variable">--format</span> <span class="token string">'{{.Repository}}:{{.Tag}}'</span> <span class="token operator">|</span> <span class="token function">grep</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-v</span> <span class="token string">'none:none'</span><span class="token variable">)</span></span><span class="token comment"># 将多行字符串转换为 Bash 数组</span><span class="token assign-left variable"><span class="token environment constant">IFS</span></span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">$'<span class="token entity" title="\n">\n</span>'</span> <span class="token builtin class-name">read</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-r</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-d</span> <span class="token string">''</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-a</span> IMAGE_ARRAY <span class="token operator">&lt;&lt;&lt;</span> <span class="token string">"<span class="token variable">$IMAGES</span>"</span><span class="token comment"># 检查是否有镜像需要打包</span><span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span> <span class="token variable">${<span class="token operator">#</span>IMAGE_ARRAY<span class="token punctuation">[</span>@<span class="token punctuation">]</span>}</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-eq</span> <span class="token number">0</span> <span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token keyword">then</span>    <span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"<span class="token variable"><span class="token variable">$(</span><span class="token function">date</span><span class="token variable">)</span></span>: ⚠️ 警告：未发现有效的本地 Docker 镜像需要打包。"</span>    <span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"--- 🎉 脚本结束 ---"</span>    <span class="token builtin class-name">exit</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token keyword">fi</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"<span class="token variable"><span class="token variable">$(</span><span class="token function">date</span><span class="token variable">)</span></span>: 共发现 <span class="token variable">${<span class="token operator">#</span>IMAGE_ARRAY<span class="token punctuation">[</span>@<span class="token punctuation">]</span>}</span> 个镜像需要打包。"</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"---"</span><span class="token comment"># 2. 循环遍历并打包每个镜像</span><span class="token keyword">for</span> <span class="token for-or-select variable">IMAGE</span> <span class="token keyword">in</span> <span class="token string">"<span class="token variable">${IMAGE_ARRAY<span class="token punctuation">[</span>@<span class="token punctuation">]</span>}</span>"</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token keyword">do</span>    <span class="token comment"># 提取镜像名称和标签，用于生成文件名。</span>    <span class="token comment"># 格式化规则：将所有的 '/' 和 ':' 替换为 '-'</span>    <span class="token assign-left variable">FILENAME</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token variable"><span class="token variable">$(</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"<span class="token variable">$IMAGE</span>"</span> <span class="token operator">|</span> <span class="token function">tr</span> / - <span class="token operator">|</span> <span class="token function">tr</span> <span class="token builtin class-name">:</span> -<span class="token variable">)</span></span>.tar        <span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"打包: <span class="token variable">${IMAGE}</span> -&gt; <span class="token variable">${FILENAME}</span>"</span>        <span class="token comment"># 执行 docker save 命令</span>    <span class="token function">docker</span> save <span class="token parameter variable">-o</span> <span class="token string">"<span class="token variable">${SAVE_DIR}</span>/<span class="token variable">${FILENAME}</span>"</span> <span class="token string">"<span class="token variable">$IMAGE</span>"</span>        <span class="token comment"># 检查上一个命令的退出状态</span>    <span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span> <span class="token variable">$?</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-eq</span> <span class="token number">0</span> <span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token keyword">then</span>        <span class="token assign-left variable">FILE_SIZE</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token variable"><span class="token variable">$(</span><span class="token function">du</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-h</span> <span class="token string">"<span class="token variable">${SAVE_DIR}</span>/<span class="token variable">${FILENAME}</span>"</span> <span class="token operator">|</span> <span class="token function">awk</span> <span class="token string">'{print $1}'</span><span class="token variable">)</span></span>        <span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"✅ 打包成功，文件大小: <span class="token variable">${FILE_SIZE}</span>"</span>    <span class="token keyword">else</span>        <span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"❌ 警告：打包失败或镜像不存在: <span class="token variable">${IMAGE}</span>"</span>    <span class="token keyword">fi</span>        <span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"---"</span><span class="token keyword">done</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">"<span class="token variable"><span class="token variable">$(</span><span class="token function">date</span><span class="token variable">)</span></span>: --- 🎉 所有镜像打包完成 ---"</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><hr>]]></content>
      
      
